  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.20 Parking Violations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.20 Parking Violations. If otherwise permitted by law and these rules, motor vehicle records shall be released for parking violations only if the requestor provides all of the following information:\n\n(1) Date of parking violation\n\n(2) License plate of vehicle;\n\n(3) Make of vehicle; and\n\n(4) Plate type.\n\nSource. #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
